// --- TELEMETRY (self-hosted — reports to server_fn/track2.php, see that file for the schema) ---
// Anonymous per-browser id (localStorage, survives slots/resets/prestige — this is about
// player behavior across the whole game, not tied to any one save) + a per-page-load session
// id. Events are queued in memory and flushed periodically plus on tab close/hide, batched
// into one POST so a fast clicker doesn't fire a request per action.
//
// track2.php, NOT track.php: the build already live on CrazyGames keeps posting to the old
// endpoint, which stays frozen so this build's changes can't affect players still on it. Both
// write to the same tables and can run side by side indefinitely. Only track2.php understands
// cg_user and returns compensation gifts (see _onGiftReceived).
const TELEMETRY_ENDPOINT = 'https://forestnothing.jcbdev.com/server_fn/track2.php';
// "Compartir mi ciudad" — same server, sibling endpoint (see server_fn/snapshot.php). POST saves
// the current city and returns a slug; GET ?slug=X fetches it back for the read-only spectator
