// By default only the "frontier" is drawn — nodes you already own (this run OR a past run,
// before a Legado reset wiped it), root nodes (no prereqs), and locked nodes whose prereqs are
// ALL already met (i.e. the immediate next pick, even if it's still waiting on a relic count).
// Anything further down an unstarted or not-yet-reached branch stays hidden so the tree doesn't
// dump its whole huge graph on screen. `stkShowAllLocked` (toggled from the panel) bypasses
// this for players who want to see the full shape of the tree — nodes still render as mystery
// ("???") until unlocked (again, this run).
let stkShowAllLocked = false;
