// On-screen +/- buttons (#zoomControls) — for players with no wheel/trackpad-pinch, or who don't
// realize either works. Zooms around the screen CENTER rather than the cursor (there isn't one
// to anchor to for a button click) — which needs no camera reposition at all: by construction of
// the render transform (ctx.translate(canvas.width/2, _gameCenterY); ctx.scale(zoom,zoom);
// ctx.translate(-cameraX,-cameraY)), the world point currently at screen-center IS (cameraX,
